{"content":[{"c":["EN-GANNIM"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Village in the lowland of Judah near Beth-shemesh (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.34","r":"Josh.15.34","rawR":"Josh.15.34","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.34","value":"Josh.15.34"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:34"},"). Some identify it with the modern Beit Jemal, but this is doubtful."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Town on the boundary of Issachar (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.19.21","r":"Josh.19.21","rawR":"Josh.19.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.19.21","value":"Josh.19.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 19:21"},"). It was a Levitical city of the Gershonites (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.21.29","r":"Josh.21.29","rawR":"Josh.21.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.21.29","value":"Josh.21.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"21:29"},") and the Anem of ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.73","r":"1Chr.6.73","rawR":"1Chr.6.73","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.73","value":"1Chr.6.73"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 6:73"},", which may be a copyist’s mistake. It seems to be the Ginaea of Josephus (",{"c":["Antiquities"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," 20.6.1). Its site is the modern Jenin, a village on the southern edge of the plain of Esdraelon, five miles (8.1 kilometers) northeast of Dothan and about 68 miles (109.4 kilometers) north of Jerusalem."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=LeviticalCities_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"LeviticalCities_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"LeviticalCities_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Levitical Cities"},"."],"sourceClass":"sp","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"EnGannim","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 15:34","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.34","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.34","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.34"},{"anchorText":"Jos 19:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.19.21","rawQueryValue":"Josh.19.21","sourceRefExact":"Josh.19.21"},{"anchorText":"21:29","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.21.29","rawQueryValue":"Josh.21.29","sourceRefExact":"Josh.21.29"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 6:73","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.73","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.73","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.73"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"16422ebb8a3ad39fb53ee6889706a492e91f97fb93d905aad2a2839352627105","sourceItemName":"EnGannim","sourceItemOrder":171,"sourceMember":"Articles/E.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"EnGannim","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"En-Gannim","title":"En-Gannim","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}